    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Loudmouth Bass</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Loudmouth_Bass.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Loudmouth Bass.png\"><img alt=\"Loudmouth Bass.png\" src=\"/images/Loudmouth_Bass.png?a6499\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;fLoudmouth Bass\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Right-click a player holding a/&amp;fLoudmouth Bass&amp;7 to engage in a duel!/&amp;7The heavier your bass is, the more/&amp;7likely it is to win!//&amp;7The winning bass will &amp;cconsume &amp;7the/&amp;7other and grow heavier.//&amp;7If your bass is consumed, you/&amp;7receive some &amp;fFish Food&amp;7 and &amp;3Social/&amp;3XP&amp;7 as compensation, scaling with/&amp;7bass weight.//&amp;7Current weight: &amp;a1 lb/&amp;8Upgrades rarity in 49 lbs//&amp;f&amp;lCOMMON\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Loudmouth Bass\"><img alt=\"Loudmouth Bass.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Loudmouth_Bass.png/32px-Loudmouth_Bass.png?a6499\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Loudmouth_Bass.png/64px-Loudmouth_Bass.png?a6499 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"0\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Common\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">COMMON</span></span></a></span>-<span data-sort-value=\"6\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Divine\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">DIVINE</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Auction House <span style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/item/LOUDMOUTH_BASS\">Prices</a></span></span><b><sup><abbr class=\"auction-house-info-icon auction-house-info-icon-no-time\" title=\"Values are updated every 15 minutes from Hypixel&#39;s API.\">ⓘ</abbr></sup></b></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Latest)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiY3VycmVudCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkxPVURNT1VUSF9CQVNTIn0=\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Daily Average)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYXZlcmFnZSIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkxPVURNT1VUSF9CQVNTIn0=\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>LOUDMOUTH_BASS</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"0\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Common\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">COMMON</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Calculator\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Calculator</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Odexar\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Odexar</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/21px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/42px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\">Seal's Treat Bag</a> has a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">11.<span style=\"text-decoration:overline;\">1</span>%</span> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span> in <span class=\"light-color color-green\">9</span>) chance to contain <b>Loudmouth Bass</b>.\n</p><p>A <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> can also be obtained as a Minor Reward during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> event, or from the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/21px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/42px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\">Gift Bag of the Century</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> can be used to challenge another player holding one to a duel. The winner's <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> will gain weight, while the losing party will lose their <b>Loudmouth Bass</b>.\n</p><p>The <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> upgrades its rarity depending on its weight:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable centertext\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Rarity\n</th>\n<th>Weight\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"0\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Common\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">COMMON</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>0-49 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Uncommon\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">UNCOMMON</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>50-2,499 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>2,500-9,999 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>10,000-24,999 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>25,000-49,999 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"5\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Mythic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-light&#95;purple\" style=\"\">MYTHIC</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>50,000-99,999 lb\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"6\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Divine\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">DIVINE</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>100,000+ lb\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The losing party is rewarded with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fish_Food\" title=\"Fish Food\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Raw_Cod.png/21px-Raw_Cod.png?25af6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Raw_Cod.png/42px-Raw_Cod.png?25af6 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Fish_Food\" title=\"Fish Food\">Fish Food</a>, and <span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span> <span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/24px-Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/48px-Emerald.png?c1511 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"font-initial\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Social</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">&#160;XP</span></span></a></span> for every <span class=\"light-color color-green\">10</span> lb their <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> had, with a minimum of <span class=\"light-color color-green\">100</span> and a maximum of <span class=\"light-color color-green\">500,000</span> <span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/24px-Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/48px-Emerald.png?c1511 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"font-initial\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Social</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">&#160;XP</span></span></a></span>.\n</p><p>The XP gained can be calculated using the following formula:\n</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>SocialXPGained</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>&#x2061;</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>&#x2061;</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">⌊</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>LoserBassWeight</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>500</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>\n</p><p>For example: If the losing player's <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> weight is between <span class=\"light-color color-green\">0</span> and <span class=\"light-color color-green\">1,000</span> lb, then they will always get <span class=\"light-color color-green\">100</span> <span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/24px-Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/48px-Emerald.png?c1511 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"font-initial\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Social</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">&#160;XP</span></span></a></span>. If the weight was <span class=\"light-color color-green\">1,010</span> lb, they will get \n<span class=\"light-color color-green\">101</span> <span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/24px-Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/48px-Emerald.png?c1511 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"font-initial\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Social\" title=\"Social\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Social</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">&#160;XP</span></span></a></span>.\n</p><p>If losing player's <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> weight was more than <span class=\"light-color color-green\">50</span> lb, they will also get a <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Skeleton_the_Fish\" title=\"Skeleton the Fish\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png/21px-Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png?5ef33\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png/42px-Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png?5ef33 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Skeleton_the_Fish\" title=\"Skeleton the Fish\">Skeleton the Fish</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Calculator\">Calculator</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Calculator\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Calculator\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<pre class=\"jcConfig\"> calcpage  = Calculator:Loudmouth Bass\n template  = Template:Calculator/Loudmouth_Bass\n form      = loudmouthBassCalcForm\n calcname  = Loudmouth Bass Calculator\n result    = inner\n\n param     = weight|Loser bass mass|0|number\n</pre>\n<div id=\"loudmouthBassCalcForm\"><div class=\"jcLoadspace\"><b>Loading Calculator...</b>\n<p><small><i>If the calculator fails to load up, please report to an <a href=\"/w/Hypixel_SkyBlock_Wiki:Staff#Administrator\" title=\"Hypixel SkyBlock Wiki:Staff\">Administrator</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Odexar\">Odexar</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Odexar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Odexar\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Loudmouth Bass</b> with a weight of at least <span class=\"light-color color-green\">101 lbs</span> can be shown to <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Odexar\" title=\"Odexar\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Odexar in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Odexar_Sprite.png/16px-Odexar_Sprite.png?41e43\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Odexar_Sprite.png/32px-Odexar_Sprite.png?41e43 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Odexar\" title=\"Odexar\">Odexar</a> to show unique dialogue.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Condition\n</th>\n<th>Dialogue\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"ct\">Winning a duel\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-2\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-a\">Your Loudmouth Bass emerged victorious and grew to &lt;new mass&gt; lbs! </span><span class=\"format-8\">(+&lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs)</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"8\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"ct\">Losing a duel\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! FEED ME MORE!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! Not even close, baby!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! Lil' bro's gone in a single bite!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! gg ez</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! Gonna cry for your bass back?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! This wasn't even half a challenge!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! Too easy! Try again in 100 year's time!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-4\"><span class=\"format-l\">CHOMP! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">Your &lt;losing bass mass&gt; lbs Loudmouth Bass was eaten! Looks like I'm a pescatarian!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">There's nothing left but bones...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"ct\">Sending a duel request\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">Sent a Loudmouth Bass duel request to </span><span class=\"format-7\">&lt;rank&gt; &lt;name&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"ct\">Sending a duel request failed\n</td>\n<td class=\"ct\">Opponent is already challenged\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">This player is already currently challenged by someone else to a Loudmouth Bass Duel!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Either of the players is no longer holding their bass\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">Someone is no longer holding their bass, so the duel was cancelled.</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Attempted challengee is not holding a Loudmouth Bass\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">This player is not holding a Loudmouth Bass!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=6&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>A <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> cannot be recombobulated.</li>\n<li>The maximum possible weight a <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> can have is <span class=\"light-color color-green\">4,000,000,000,000,000 lbs</span>, or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Names_of_large_numbers\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Names of large numbers\">4 quadrillion</a>. After reaching this weight, its weight will not increase further.\n<ul><li>Despite it not increasing further beyond this point, chat feedback will say it does. This does not reflect in the item's description nor NBT data.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>It would take <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/21px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/42px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><abbr title=\"14,062 stacks plus 41\" tabindex=\"0\">900,009</abbr></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\">Seal's Treat Bag</a>, worth <span data-auction-house=\"eyJjb2luIjp0cnVlLCJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJjYWxjQnV5UHJpY2VzIiwicHJpY2VfdHlwZSI6ImN1cnJlbnQiLCJlbnRyaWVzIjpbWyJTRUFMX1RSRUFUX0JBRyIsOTAwMDA5XV0sIml0ZW1JZCI6IjxMT0FESU5HLi4uPiJ9\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-calcBuyPrices\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">???</span></abbr></span>, to reach <span data-sort-value=\"6\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Divine\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">DIVINE</span></span></a></span> rarity.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"References\">References</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=7&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: References\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Loudmouth_Bass_4,000,000,000,000,000.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/Loudmouth_Bass_4%2C000%2C000%2C000%2C000%2C000.png?cad04\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"654\" height=\"133\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"654\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></a></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?section=8&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Loudmouth_Bass?action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/January_28\" title=\"Changelog/2025/January 28\">Jan&#160;28,&#160;2025</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Loudmouth_Bass.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Loudmouth_Bass.png/26px-Loudmouth_Bass.png?a6499\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Loudmouth_Bass.png/52px-Loudmouth_Bass.png?a6499 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Loudmouth Bass</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/March_18\" title=\"Changelog/2025/March 18\">Mar&#160;18,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.22</th><td>Added <b>Loudmouth Bass</b> to <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/21px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png/42px-Seal%27s_Treat_Bag.png?601ec 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Seal%27s_Treat_Bag\" title=\"Seal&#39;s Treat Bag\">Seal's Treat Bag</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/October_15\" title=\"Changelog/2025/October 15\">Oct&#160;15,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.23.5</th><td>Changed <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Skeleton_the_Fish\" title=\"Skeleton the Fish\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png/21px-Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png?5ef33\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png/42px-Enchanted_Cooked_Cod.png?5ef33 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Skeleton_the_Fish\" title=\"Skeleton the Fish\">Skeleton the Fish</a> requirement from <span class=\"light-color color-green\">1,000</span> lb to <span class=\"light-color color-green\">50</span> lb.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐s28qf\nCached time: 20261023052907\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 1.405 seconds\nReal time usage: 2.241 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 787/1000000\nRevision size: 5181/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 32498/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1793/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1965/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0